iot/sensors/{location}/ambient_light/{sensorId}/data

Examples:
iot/sensors/living_room/ambient_light/sensor_001/data
iot/sensors/kitchen/ambient_light/sensor_002/data
iot/sensors/bedroom/ambient_light/sensor_003/data

Payload:
{
  "sensorId": "sensor_001",
  "location": "living_room", 
  "ambientLight": 450,
  "timestamp": 1678886400000,
  "batteryLevel": 85
}